<v Davy Rothbart>The runs.
<v Davy Rothbart>腹泻。

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:52.390
<v Barbara>The rust?
<v Barbara>铁锈？

00:22:52.390 --> 00:22:56.660
<v Davy Rothbart>She's still clearly very deaf.
<v Davy Rothbart>她显然还是非常耳聋。

00:22:56.660 --> 00:23:05.970
<v Announcer>Ladies and gentlemen, it's the comedy musings of Ken.
<v Announcer>女士们先生们，这是肯的喜剧随笔。

